<title>LITHUANIA: LATEST ECONOMIC INDICATORS - LITHUANIA.</title>
<headline>LATEST ECONOMIC INDICATORS - LITHUANIA.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's latest economic statistics,</p>
<p>in percentage changes on a month-on-month basis unless</p>
<p>otherwise indicated.</p>
<p>Publication dates of new figures are approximate.</p>
<p>INDICATOR		  PERIOD    PCT     A YR AGO    LAST-NEXT</p>
<p>Inflation		   March     +0.1	n/a     07/04-07/05</p>
<p>			     1Q	  +3.5     +8.1     07/04-07/07</p>
<p>Trade balance (bln LTL) 1996     -4.5	n/a     24/02-24/03</p>
<p>GDP (bln LTL)	     Q3 1996   8.5	6.7     24/02-n/a</p>
<p>PPI			   Jan	 0.5	n/a     24/02-n/a</p>
<p>PPI (YR/YR)		 Jan	11.4	n/a     24/02-06/04</p>
<p>Unemployment		March     6.2	8.3     04/04-04/05</p>
<p>Note - All inflation figures before January 1997 are</p>
<p>currently being recalucalted to conform to Euro stat methods.</p>
<p>Revised figures are due to be released in April.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
